pyglenn

Copyright (c) 2026 Dr. Reginaldo G. Leão Jr.

This project is a Python implementation providing functional parity with the
Glenn.jl package (https://github.com/ProfLeao/Glenn.jl), which establishes the
NASA-7 data model and the bundled SQLite schema.

The bundled thermochemical dataset (src/pyglenn/data/thermo.inp and
src/pyglenn/data/thermo.db) is derived from NASA Glenn/CEA polynomial data
(NASA TP-2002-211556). Those polynomials are normalized with the CODATA 1986
gas constant (8.314510 J/(mol·K)); pyglenn denormalizes them with that
dataset-specific reference constant, as recorded in the database `metadata`
table.
